    "title": "Dillon Danis impresses legends in gutsy 14-4 defeat to Colby Covington at RAF7",
    "text": "Dillon Danis and Colby Covington’s highly-anticipated wrestling match ended in little to no drama tonight in Tampa.The controversial duo are known as two of MMA’s most notorious heels, and agreed to a match on tonight’s RAF Wrestling event. After a relatively tame build-up, their pre-event press conference on Friday became deeply personal as families were invoked in the most gross of ways. Arrow Left #1 Icon Created with Sketch. Arrow right #1 Icon Created with Sketch. Describe Dillon Danis’ career in one word. Let us know what you think of the controversial grappling specialist below. Dillon Danis poses at the New York premiere of ‘Road House’. Credit: John Nacion/Variety via Getty Images cwthoma4935Featured commentEmbarrassingangellt078Featured commentWanna benelsonrebarindustriesFeatured commentWho? I’m sorry what did he do? He trained a UFC fighter for a fight…. Google says he Won a BJJ tournament over a decade ago not called ADCC so that’s something I think… Irrelevant is the best word? Nobody maybe? I’m not sure why BE is like glorifying this twitter ranter as a “career fighter”. It’s laughable He’s 2-0 mma fighter. His best move is emojis on X. And given Danis’ lack of experience on the mats, it was always expected that things would go sideways when the bell finally did ring. However, the undefeated MMA star competed well and even scored four points in what was on paper a complete and utter mismatch.HURT FEELINGS: Colby Covington’s UFC White House snub upset Chael SonnenColby Covington vs Dillon Danis RAF7 resultGiven that wrestling events have same-day weigh-ins, fans would have been forgiven for waiting until this morning to be assured that Dillon Danis would actually show up for today’s event. However, he did tip the scales at 199.6lb and his bout with Colby Covington became official.Danis infamously made a mockery of his boxing match with Logan Paul when the pair fought back in 2023, and was perhaps expected to do something similar this time out. However, he expressed extreme disappointment about how that went, and remains a competitive athlete. View Instagram Post And it seemed to be the best case scenario for both men as Danis scored two separate times and ended the first period with the score at 4-4. He didn’t try any shenanigans at all, and even though Covington got the victory the BJJ specialist earned the respect of Kurt Angle and Chael Sonnen on commentary.After the fact, it was expected that there may be handbags between the pair. Instead, they simply embraced, shared a few words and Covington went on to call out Chris Weidman for his next RAF Wrestling outing.Join Our NewsletterReceive a digest of our best Bloody Elbow content each week direct to your mailbox",
